        <div class="story__content">
            <h2 class="story__title" data-i18n="story.0.title">Building Rockets Like Cars</h2>
            <p class="story__text" data-i18n="story.0.text.0">
                Rocket Factory Augsburg AG is one of the first commercial European companies to develop an orbital-class launcher capable of delivering a variety of payloads with high flexibility.
            </p>
            <p class="story__text" data-i18n-html="story.0.text.1">
                Its uniqueness stands in the successful full in-house development of <strong>Europe's first oxygen-rich
                staged combustion (ORSC) engine</strong> called HELIX, capable of delivering roughly 100kN of thrust.
            </p>
